@startuml "Authentification du staff événement"

title Authentification et autorisation du staff pour le contrôle d'événement

actor "Contrôleur\n(Staff événement)" as Controller
participant "App Mobile\n(Scan QR)" as MobileApp
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Auth Middleware" as Auth
participant "Event Service" as EventSvc
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

== Authentification du staff ==
Controller -> MobileApp: Ouvrir app de contrôle
MobileApp -> API: POST /api/auth/login
note right: Body: {email, password, eventId}

API -> Auth: Vérifier credentials + rôle ORGANIZER/STAFF
Auth -> DB: SELECT user WHERE email=? AND (role='ORGANIZER' OR role='STAFF')
DB --> Auth: staff user data

Auth -> EventSvc: verifyEventAccess(userId, eventId)
EventSvc -> DB: SELECT event WHERE id=? AND (organizerId=? OR staff_members CONTAINS ?)
DB --> EventSvc: event access verified

Auth --> API: staff authenticated for event
API --> MobileApp: {token, eventInfo, permissions}
MobileApp --> Controller: Mode contrôle activé

@enduml